{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PHANTOM is a Single Player Ghost Hunting game,</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With 15 Planned Locations Inspired by Real, and Unusual Places, </strong> <br><strong>Like Pirate Ships and Cave Systems.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20 Different Ghost Types, with 3 Evidence Per Ghost Type. and 11 Evidence Total. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With a EMF Reader,\u00a0Parabolic Mic,\u00a0UV Light, Spirit box, Thermometer, and Camera as your Main Evidence Items.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462440/extras/e2b345214612cddce62556b4030230e0.avif?t=1757053659\" data-has-big width=1560 height=444 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You explore, and investigate Haunted, and typically Abandoned locations</strong>.<br><br><strong>Identify the ghost</strong>'s Main Evidence to complete the<br>Main Investigation, via EMF, UV, And Parabolic evidence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then you can stick around to complete the<br>Side Investigation, via the ghost's Age, Cause of Death, Favorite Item, and Wall Writing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your Equipment</strong>, from longer EMF Range, Faster Player Speed,<br>Faster Thermometer readings,\u00a0to even Speech-to-text for the Spirit Box.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buy Equipment</strong>. A Smartwatch to monitor your Stress, to a UV Tripod to light up a room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level up, and explore more locations.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462440/extras/756b51ee7e32269d75e4f042911ab36c.avif?t=1757053659\" data-has-big width=1560 height=444 /></span><strong>EQUIPMENT:</strong><br></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >EMF Reader - See the ghost throw an item, turn on a TV, or move some furniture?<br>Chances are, it left some evidence there.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thermometer - When a ghost is Haunting a room, the temperature may Raise, Lower,<br>or in some cases even stay the same. May be useful for identifying where the ghost is.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Camera - Useful for finding Side Evidence like Wall Writing.<br>May be useful for identifying many of the ghost's Traits as well...!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parabolic Microphone - Allows you to hear many of the ghost's interactions,<br>as well as their Main Evidence, Like Screams or Whispers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spirit Box - Useful for completing the Side Investigation,<br>as well as identifying the room of a Inactive Ghost.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >UV Light - Used to spot Fingerprints, Footprints, or Claw Marks from the ghost.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flashlight - Lights up dark areas.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462440/extras/8840c3f3f5e2062b18d5ea69d2828289.avif?t=1757053659\" data-has-big width=1560 height=446 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>LOCATIONS:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The locations in this game are inspired by Real, and Unusual places.<br>From more Typical locations like a House or a School,<br>to more unique ones like a Pirate Ship, or a Cave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462440/extras/89ed31058a20b2a625543ac39ba66a4d.avif?t=1757053659\" data-has-big width=1560 height=444 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OTHER THINGS TO KNOW:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I'm a solo developer, and this is the first PC game I started working on, over 2 years ago! </strong><br><br>This game is, and always will be: Single Player Only!<br>I know a lot of players would prefer multiplayer,<br>But this is a slow-paced, Investigation game, and not really suited, or balanced for multiplayer.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2462440?t=1757053659","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462440/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757053659","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462440/a055b6990e46b6564f8eb581e7ba2af0c5dc1b9c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757053659","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2462440/a055b6990e46b6564f8eb581e7ba2af0c5dc1b9c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757053659","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PHANTOM is a Single Player Ghost Hunting game,</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With 15 Planned Locations Inspired by Real, and Unusual Places, </strong> <br><strong>Like Pirate Ships and Cave Systems.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20 Different Ghost Types, with 3 Evidence Per Ghost Type. and 11 Evidence Total. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With a EMF Reader,\u00a0Parabolic Mic,\u00a0UV Light, Spirit box, Thermometer, and Camera as your Main Evidence Items.</st